### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Database health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/health/db
Accept: application/json

###

### Voice assignment (DB-based hospital recommendation)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transcript": "Male in his 60s, chest pain and shortness of breath, alert, en route to 123 Gangnam-daero",
  "client_location": {
    "latitude": 37.4979,
    "longitude": 127.0276,
    "address": "123 Gangnam-daero, Gangnam-gu, Seoul"
  },
  "paramedic_id": "EMT-001"
}

###

### Nearby hospitals (location-based)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/hospitals/nearby?latitude=37.4979&longitude=127.0276&limit=5
Accept: application/json

###

### Hospital incoming patient status
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/hospitals/{{hospital_id}}/patients
Accept: application/json

###

### Hospital ER wait time
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/hospitals/{{hospital_id}}/wait-time
Accept: application/json

###
